{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fun, fast-paced drifting game on mountain roads.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driftline Peaks is all about high-speed driving and stylish drifting on twisty mountain passes. The roads are tight, the corners are sharp, and every run tests your control. The physics are arcade-style and easy to pick up but with enough depth to keep you improving overtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919490/extras/5771f1a060d27f215fb6143f8c9eec39.poster.avif?t=1773242549\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919490/extras/5771f1a060d27f215fb6143f8c9eec39.webm?t=1773242549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919490/extras/5771f1a060d27f215fb6143f8c9eec39.mp4?t=1773242549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So what\u2019s in the game?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain stages (Downhill and Uphill)</strong>: Race different routes, with day, night and weather (rain, snow, etc.) versions for extra challenge and variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple cars</strong>: Pick from a selection of cars, each with their own handling feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes</strong>: Time trials, races against AI, drift challenge,  and free roam to practice your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Play with a friend and compete online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replays</strong>:\u00a0Watch your best (or worst) runs back to see where you can improve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a simple, low-poly look inspired by classic racing games, but with smooth controls and satisfying drifting and driving. Whether you\u2019re just here for fun or trying to set the fastest time, there\u2019s plenty to keep you hooked.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop in, hit the gas, and see how well you can handle the mountain!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919490?t=1773242549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919490/53caaacdb7cae2ab5140ea7fb929ceeecc61124d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773242549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919490/fba0c7698d52fbc8479ec6b21d1af6547de65a7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773242549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919490/fba0c7698d52fbc8479ec6b21d1af6547de65a7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773242549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3978180,"description":""},{"appid":3978180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fun, fast-paced drifting game on mountain roads.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driftline Peaks is all about high-speed driving and stylish drifting on twisty mountain passes. The roads are tight, the corners are sharp, and every run tes